<item>
            <title>[BOOKKEEPER-952] Fix RegionAwarePlacementPolicy</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/BOOKKEEPER-952</link>
                <project id="12311293" key="BOOKKEEPER">Bookkeeper</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;TestRegionAwareEnsemblePlacementPolicy#testNewEnsembleWithThreeRegions is failing because RegionAwareEnsemblePlacementPolicy is not working as expected.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The current allocation policy is not evenly across the regions. The write quorum size is also not calculated correctly.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;We need  to fix the placement policy and then fix the the test case.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
